    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Magic Absorption.</strong> Once per turn, when you take damage from a spell or a magical effect, you reduce the total damage you take by 1d4. You can’t use this benefit while you have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p><strong>Spellfire Flame.</strong> You learn the Sacred Flame cantrip. Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma is your spellcasting ability for it (choose when you take this feat). You can also cast this cantrip as a Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-QtadOgSVqYfrzACo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Magic Absorption</em> rolls the reduction to subtract from the damage. Spend a use of the feat with <em>Bonus Action Casting</em> when you cast Sacred Flame as a Bonus Action.</p></section>",
